OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain occasional
OL,7,Fheavy and persistent with cloud
OL,8,Flowering onto the hills at times.
OL,9,FWinds mostly light and rather variable
OL,10,Fin direction.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will push
OL,13,Fnorthwards during the evening, heavy
OL,14,Fat times. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,15,Freturning from the west overnight.
OL,16,FBreezy around the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
