OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and bright with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells in the morning. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing with occasional rain or
OL,8,Fshowers during the afternoon, the rain
OL,9,Fturning persistent and heavy in the
OL,10,Fsouth later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,13,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,14,FFriday, the showers becoming lighter
OL,15,Fand well scattered on Saturday with
OL,16,Feasing winds. Heavy rain expected on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
